      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Is the Life Fitness 95T discontinued?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes. On 5 November 2026 Life Fitness’s US catalogue page for the Elevation Series treadmill, the 95T, was headed \"Product Discontinued\" and named the Integrity+ as its replacement. Life Fitness’s business-only Facility Shop still listed one with the SE3 HD console at $16,999. Home buyers find the 95T remanufactured or used.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much is a remanufactured Life Fitness 95T?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "On 5 November 2026 Fitness Superstore listed remanufactured 95Ts at $4,099 with the Achieve or Inspire console, $4,199 with the Engage or Discover SI and $4,999 with the Discover SE3, each with a one-year parts and on-site labour warranty. Freight is extra and prices change often.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "What is the difference between the Life Fitness 95T and 95Ti?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "The 95Ti is the older model, with a 20-inch-wide belt and an LED console. The 95T is the Elevation Series treadmill that followed, with a 22 by 60-inch deck, the DX3 belt and deck system and a choice of consoles. Both have 4 HP AC motors, 15% incline and 400 lb ratings.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "What are the Life Fitness 95T specs?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Life Fitness lists a 4 HP (8.0 HP peak) AC motor with MagnaDrive controller, a 22 by 60-inch running surface, 0.5 to 14 mph, 15% incline, a 400 lb maximum user and a dedicated 120 V, 20 A circuit. Remanufacturer listings agree and give an 80 by 37-inch footprint and 442 to 444 lb depending on the console.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "What is the Life Fitness 95T Inspire?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "It is the 95T Elevation Series treadmill fitted with the Inspire console, a display with a long program list including terrain courses, heart-rate workouts and fitness tests, and no reliance on a network. Fitness Superstore listed a remanufactured 95T Inspire at $4,099 on 5 November 2026.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "What does \"95T Discover SE inc WiFi\" mean?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "It describes a 95T Elevation treadmill with the Discover SE touchscreen console and network connectivity; \"inc\" is UK shorthand for \"including\". The running hardware is the same as any 95T. Before paying extra, check which of the console’s apps and TV features still work on the unit you are buying.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Is a remanufactured Life Fitness 95Ti worth buying?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "It can be at $2,600 to $3,800 from a remanufacturer with a written warranty, if you have a dedicated 20-amp circuit. Sellers disagree on its top speed, 12 or 14 mph, so confirm it on the unit. For about $3,900, a new Life Fitness Run CX is the simpler choice for most homes.",
          },
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      description: description,
      author: { "@type": "Person", "@id": "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/editorial-standards/#shaheer-ali-khan", name: "Shaheer Ali Khan", honorificSuffix: "PhD", jobTitle: "Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist", url: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/editorial-standards/#who", sameAs: ["https://www.linkedin.com/in/shaheer-ali-khan-data/"], worksFor: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Treadmill Reviews USA" } },
      datePublished: "2026-11-05",
      dateModified: "2026-11-05",
      publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Treadmill Reviews USA" },
    },
    ...PRODUCTS.map((product) => ({
      "@type": "Product",
      name: product.name,
      description: product.description,
      ...(product.brand ? { brand: { "@type": "Brand", name: product.brand } } : {}),
      ...(product.image ? { image: product.image.url } : {}),
      ...(product.priceBounds
        ? {
            offers: {
              "@type": "AggregateOffer",
              priceCurrency: "USD",
              lowPrice: product.priceBounds.low,
              highPrice: product.priceBounds.high,
              url: product.amazonUrl,
            },
          }
        : {}),
    })),
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      name: title,
      numberOfItems: 3,
      itemListElement: PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => ({
        "@type": "ListItem",
        position: index + 1,
        name: product.name,
        url: `https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/life-fitness-95t-treadmill/#${product.id}`,
      })),
    },
  ],
};
---

<Layout
