          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Life Fitness 95T and 95Ti: <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">Buying a Remanufactured Club Treadmill</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          The Life Fitness 95T, sold as the Elevation Series treadmill with Achieve, Inspire, Engage and Discover consoles, and the older 95Ti were fixtures of American gyms. Both are discontinued, and both are now sold remanufactured for a fraction of their new price. Here is what the figures are, how the consoles differ, what remanufacturers charged on 5 November 2026, and how to buy one well.
