          <a href="#specs" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. Life Fitness 95T and 95Ti Specifications</a>
          <a href="#consoles" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. The 95T Consoles Compared</a>
          <a href="#models" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. Remanufactured Prices, and the New Alternative</a>
          <a href="#buying-remanufactured" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. How to Buy a Remanufactured 95T or 95Ti</a>
          <a href="#home-install" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. Putting a 95T in Your Home</a>
          <a href="#alternatives" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">8. Remanufactured 95T or New Life Fitness?</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. Frequently Asked Questions</a>
